<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<header class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY PORTAL</span><h1>Professor Assistant</h1><p>Get help with submitting feedback, tracking progress, and using the system.</p></div></header>
<% if (!geminiEnabled) { %><div class="notice" role="status">Professor is currently unavailable. You can still submit feedback and track your submissions using the navigation menu.</div><% } %>
<div class="assistant-layout"><section class="assistant-window" aria-label="Professor conversation"><div class="assistant-heading"><img class="assistant-mark" src="/images/professor.jpg" alt="Professor" width="52" height="52"><div><h2>Professor</h2><p>Your guide to CSPConnect</p></div></div><div id="assistant-log" class="chat-log" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text"><article class="chat-message chat-assistant"><strong>Professor</strong><p>Hello. I can help you understand how to submit and track feedback, use the Community Feed, or find your way around the portal. What would you like to know?</p></article></div><form id="assistant-form" class="assistant-form" method="post" action="/api/professor"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="sr-only" for="assistant-message">Your question for Professor</label><div class="assistant-input-row"><textarea id="assistant-message" name="message" rows="2" maxlength="1000" required placeholder="Ask about the feedback system…"></textarea><button id="assistant-send" class="button button-primary" type="submit">Send message</button></div><p id="assistant-status" class="assistant-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section><aside><section class="form-notes"><h2>How can Professor help?</h2><p>Ask a question or choose a starting point below.</p><div class="prompt-list"><button class="prompt-button" type="button" data-assistant-prompt="How do I submit feedback?">How do I submit feedback?</button><button class="prompt-button" type="button" data-assistant-prompt="How does anonymous feedback work?">How does anonymous feedback work?</button><button class="prompt-button" type="button" data-assistant-prompt="What do the feedback statuses mean?">What do the feedback statuses mean?</button><button class="prompt-button" type="button" data-assistant-prompt="How do I use the Community Feed?">How do I use the Community Feed?</button></div><div class="note-divider"><h2>A guide to the system</h2><p>Professor provides general help with this portal. For official CSPC policies or decisions about your feedback, refer to administrative responses or contact the appropriate school office.</p></div></section></aside></div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
